  "rationale": "The plant automata model the robot's motion commands and perception of obstacles. The specification automata bind sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforce conservative recovery, and restrict backward/full_rotate usage to rare, justified cases. The design ensures safety by always handling uncontrollable events first, uses directed turns for obstacle recovery, and only escalates to backward or full_rotate actions when strictly necessary.",
